# A creature can attack or use a {T} ability only if its controller has controlled it continuously since their most
# recent turn began (CR 302.6), and an animated land is a creature (the card's ruling). Bot1 plays one Inkmoth Nexus on
# turn 1 and a second on turn 3, and animates both on turn 3 with the two Moxes. The first, controlled since the turn
# began, taps for {C} while a creature; the second, which entered this turn, may not (refused), nor attack (refused,
# beside Ornithopter, which attacks). On turn 5 the second has been controlled since the turn began: animated again it
# attacks, and Bot2 gets a poison counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Inkmoth Nexus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Inkmoth Nexus
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

