? Bot1.Mana = {C}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Inkmoth Nexus#2.Activate(Ability: {T})
! Bot1.Attack(Inkmoth Nexus#2 > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
